      "role": "user",
      "content": "The model response seems to have cut off mid-sentence. Could you finish that thought on manganese and then maybe expand a bit on what happens to the grapevine itself if these levels get out of balance? I need to know what the specific deficiency symptoms look like in the leaves.",
      "source": "evaluator"
